  "dock": {
    "_note": "Upper panel. Its bottom edge is the shell's top edge offset outward by `gap`, so the shell's raised title ear and tool pod seat into matching notches and the seam stays one width all the way across. Arc radii follow the offset rule: convex arcs grow by gap, concave arcs shrink by gap, centres unchanged. Left and right edges are aligned with the shell's so the two pieces read as one column.",
