    "right": 1648,
    "top": 94,
    "r_top": 30,
    "r_bot": 16,
    "_ear": "A raised title ear on the top edge, the rhyme of the shell's: same r=29 corner, and an S-fillet built by the same rule (dx^2 = drop * (4r - drop), so drop 24 with r 30 gives dx 48 exactly). It spans x 52..340 -- long enough that the script title and its caption both finish before the step down, which they did not at 300 -- and the blossom straddles its corner the way the mockup's does. The main top sits at 94 rather than hard against the canvas: the bottom edge is pinned by the joint, so every pixel of top clearance is a pixel off the content area, and 94 is as low as the three bays can go and still hold their rows.",
