    "_lit": "Both horizontal faces are lit, for two different reasons. The top faces the shell's bottom rim, which is the brightest line in the scene and sits 13 away -- the same mutual glow that sells the dock's joint. The bottom is now the outermost edge of the whole column, so it inherits the treatment the shell's bottom had: near-white at full opacity, with the bloom confined to the desk side.",
